      "D0": "All income from this employment is taxed at the higher rate.",
      "D1": "All income from this employment is taxed at the additional rate.",
      "SBR": "All income from this employment is taxed at the Scottish basic rate.",
      "SD0": "All income from this employment is taxed at the Scottish intermediate rate.",
      "SD1": "All income from this employment is taxed at the Scottish higher rate.",
      "SD2": "All income from this employment is taxed at the Scottish advanced rate.",
      "SD3": "All income from this employment is taxed at the Scottish top rate.",
      "0T": "No Personal Allowance is applied.",
      "NT": "No Income Tax is deducted."
    },
    "note": "Band indices refer to the bands_taxable_income_gbp array of the matching jurisdiction in this same ruleset, so statutory rates are defined once. K codes and Week 1/Month 1 markers are intentionally unsupported by the annual estimate model."
